# DAX: DAX function reference and DAX syntax (Microsoft); requirements/languages/dax.md
name     dax
keyword  VAR RETURN EVALUATE DEFINE MEASURE ORDER BY ASC DESC TRUE FALSE IN NOT AND OR
builtin  CALCULATE SUM SUMX FILTER ALL ALLEXCEPT DIVIDE IF SWITCH COUNTROWS DISTINCTCOUNT RELATED
builtin  AVERAGE MAX MIN BLANK DATEADD SAMEPERIODLASTYEAR VALUES SELECTEDVALUE
fold-case
line-comment   // --
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : doubled
string   ' '  : name
operators  +-*/^&=<>|,()[]
calls
